      "Formed in 1952, with roots in the Electric Boat Company founded in 1899. Phebe Novakovic has been CEO since 2013; in October 2026 the board elected president Danny Deep to succeed her on 1 January 2027, when she becomes executive chairman. General Dynamics builds nuclear submarines through Electric Boat, combat vehicles including the Abrams tank, and IT systems for government — and separately owns Gulfstream, the business jet manufacturer. That combination of defence and luxury aviation is unique among the primes and gives it a quite different profile from Lockheed or Northrop.",
